 "remarks": "SONO 3 bedroom 2.5 Bath Tri-Level Townhome, a great place to live, chic dining and shopping only steps away. This townhouse is bright and spacious. The open floor plan makes it great for entertaining off the updated kitchen with center island and hardwood floors. 2 large bedrooms, and bath on 2nd floor. Upper level has a Primary suite with large closets, primary bath and deck with view of the water. 2 car attached garage with direct access into lower level with washer dryer and half bath. GREAT PLACE TO LIVE AND ENJOY DINING, ENTERTAINMENT, WALK TO R/R, and to enjoy VIBRANT SOUTH NORWALK .",
